 ### User requests
# REST Client file for user endpoints.

# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@userId = 12345

### Users - Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Users - Get user by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Users - Get user by email
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/email/user@example.com
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Users - Update user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}

### Users - Delete user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Users - List all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
